Keep a CryptoKey's key material away from guest code. Deno puts
its clone data (the material) behind hostObjectBrand, a registered symbol
any code can call, and the material itself on kKeyObject; here it goes
through core.setHostObject (a V8 private) and core.registerPrivateCloneable.

